"{\"url\":\"https://registry.isometric.com/project/prj_1K3MGXD4A1S0S3H8\",\"title\":\"La Perla — Isometric\",\"head\":[\"VALIDATED\",\"EW\",\"1,000Y+\",\"La Perla\",\"Silica\",\"ISSUED\",\"322.54\",\"BUFFER POOL\",\"6.451\",\"CREDITING PERIOD\",\"12 Mar 2025 to 31 Jan 2030\",\"Summary\"],\"issued_header\":\"322.54\",\"buffer_header\":\"6.451\",\"crediting\":\"12 Mar 2025 to 31 Jan 2030\",\"verifier\":\"Verifit\",\"code\":\"RGQX\",\"approval\":\"24 Aug 2026\",\"protocol_current\":\"Enhanced Weathering in Agriculture v1.1\",\"protocol_baseline\":null,\"cert_issued\":\"322.54\",\"cert_retired\":\"0\",\"cert_buffer\":\"6.451\",\"reversal\":\"The risk of reversal for this project has been assessed as very low. This means that 2% of certificates issued for this project are allocated to Silica's buffer pool.\\n\\nTo date, this project has contributed 6.451 certificates to the buffer pool which holds a total of 6.451 certificates.\\n\\nSilica has no reversals to date.\",\"showing\":[\"Showing 1 of 1\",\"Showing 4 of 4\",\"Showing 1 of 1\"],\"tables\":[{\"heads\":[\"Name\",\"Category\",\"Validated\"],\"rows\":[[\"Volcanic Ash\",\"Mineral & rock\",\"23 Apr 2026\"]]},{\"heads\":[\"Submission date\",\"Title\",\"Download\"],\"rows\":[[\"24 Aug 2026\",\"Validation and Verification Report\",\"PDF | ->\"],[\"24 Aug 2026\",\"GHG Statement Report\",\"PDF | ->\"],[\"06 Feb 2026\",\"Public Comment Summary\",\"PDF | ->\"],[\"06 Jan 2026\",\"PDD\",\"PDF | ->\"]]},{\"heads\":[\"Issue date\",\"Issued\",\"Buffer pool\",\"Supplier allocation\"],\"rows\":[[\"24 Aug 2026\",\"322.54\",\"6.451\",\"316.089\"]]}],\"links\":[{\"h\":\"/supplier/spl_1JPJSK7EV1S0JZTD\",\"t\":\"Silica\"},{\"h\":\"https://verifit.com.br\",\"t\":\"Verifit\"},{\"h\":\"/protocol/enhanced-weathering-agriculture/1.1\",\"t\":\"Enhanced Weathering in Agriculture v1.1\"},{\"h\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/isometric--production--eu--public-documents/spl_1JPJSK7EV1S0JZTD/prj_1K3MGXD4A1S0S3H8/pjd_1KEAEZBN61S0TPD4/pdd.pdf\",\"t\":\"Project Design Document | 06 Jan 2026\"},{\"h\":\"/ghg-entry/rmv_1KS2X7AY21S02KS7?tab=calculation-view\",\"t\":\"See GHG entry →\"},{\"h\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/isometric--production--eu--public-documents/spl_1JPJSK7EV1S0JZTD/prj_1K3MGXD4A1S0S3H8/pjd_1M0S9QQF61S0JW03/validation_and_verification_report.pdf\",\"t\":\"PDF | ->\"},{\"h\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/isometric--production--eu--public-documents/spl_1JPJSK7EV1S0JZTD/prj_1K3MGXD4A1S0S3H8/pjd_1M0S9PF4H1S0BJ8S/ghg_statement_report.pdf\",\"t\":\"PDF | ->\"},{\"h\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/isometric--production--eu--public-documents/spl_1JPJSK7EV1S0JZTD/prj_1K3MGXD4A1S0S3H8/pjd_1KGS3TFWK1S0BSVK/public_comment_summary.pdf\",\"t\":\"PDF | ->\"},{\"h\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/isometric--production--eu--public-documents/spl_1JPJSK7EV1S0JZTD/prj_1K3MGXD4A1S0S3H8/pjd_1KEAEZBN61S0TPD4/pdd.pdf\",\"t\":\"PDF | ->\"}],\"text\":\"VALIDATED\\nEW\\n1,000Y+\\nLa Perla\\nSilica\\nISSUED\\n322.54\\nBUFFER POOL\\n6.451\\nCREDITING PERIOD\\n12 Mar 2025 to 31 Jan 2030\\nSummary\\nRemoval method\\nCalculation overview\\nFeedstocks\\nProject documentation\\nCertificates\\nReversal risk\\nSummary\\n\\nThe La Perla project involves spreading highly-reactive volcanic feedstock across 231 hectares of sugarcane fields, in partnership with smallholder farmers, to permanently deliver a net removal of over 2,100 tonnes of CO₂ and improve crop yields.\\n\\nPROJECT DETAILS\\nCurrent verifier\\nVerifit\\n->\\nProject code\\nRGQX\\nApproval date\\n24 Aug 2026\\nCurrent protocol version\\nEnhanced Weathering in Agriculture v1.1\\n⌘ + scroll to zoom\\nLa Perla\\nHow carbon is being removed\\n\\nEnhanced Weathering (EW) accelerates the Earth's natural chemical weathering process to remove carbon dioxide from the atmosphere. In chemical weathering, carbon dioxide dissolved in rainwater reacts with minerals in rocks, partly dissolving them and producing stable bicarbonate ions. These bicarbonate ions are transported by rivers to the ocean, where they are safely stored for thousands of years. EW is typically carried out by spreading crushed reactive rocks or minerals on croplands.\\n\\nProject Design Document\\n06 Jan 2026\\nCalculation overview\\nCalculations demonstrating 322.54 tCO₂e removed from La Perla on 29 Jan 2026\\nSee GHG entry →\\nNet CO₂e Removed\\n322.536 tCO₂e\\nSequestrations\\n369.340 tCO₂e\\n-\\nActivities\\n42.645 tCO₂e\\n-\\nUncertainty Discount\\n4.159 tCO₂e\\n⌘ + scroll to zoom\\nView full screen\\nFeedstocks\\n\\nFeedstocks are the validated input materials that have been used for this project.\\n\\nName\\tCategory\\tValidated\\nVolcanic Ash\\tMineral & rock\\t23 Apr 2026\\nShowing 1 of 1\\nPrevious\\nNext\\nProject documentation\\nSubmission date\\tTitle\\tDownload\\n24 Aug 2026\\tValidation and Verification Report\\tPDF\\n->\\n\\n24 Aug 2026\\tGHG Statement Report\\tPDF\\n->\\n\\n06 Feb 2026\\tPublic Comment Summary\\tPDF\\n->\\n\\n06 Jan 2026\\tPDD\\tPDF\\n->\\nShowing 4 of 4\\nPrevious\\nNext\\nCertificates\\nIssued\\n322.54\\nRetired\\n0\\nBuffer pool\\n6.451\\nCrediting period\\n12 Mar 2025 to 31 Jan 2030\\nIssuances\\nRetirements\\nIssue date\\tIssued\\tBuffer pool\\tSupplier allocation\\n24 Aug 2026\\t322.54\\t6.451\\t316.089\\nShowing 1 of 1\\nPrevious\\nNext\\nReversal risk\\n\\nThe risk of reversal for this project has been assessed as very low. This means that 2% of certificates issued for this project are allocated to Silica's buffer pool.\\n\\nTo date, this project has contributed 6.451 certificates to the buffer pool which holds a total of 6.451 certificates.\\n\\nSilica has no reversals to date.\\n\\nLearn more about reversal risk\"}"